Copy a shelf, or move it into a shelf of shelves
Long-press the Home tab
Tap Copy. Home (copy) opens in the editor
Tap Move to… to put the copy in another shelf
Tap Spooky, a shelf of shelves
The copy is inside Spooky now, and Home stays put
Tap Spooky to see the shelves it holds
The + Add shelf tile can move a shelf in too
